cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Thermal Battery Simulator: 3D simulation of sand-battery thermal stores"
abstract: >-
  Coupled 3D simulator of a sand-battery thermal store: the packed bed, the vessel
  envelope and the whole gas circuit solved together, with an anisotropic box-tree mesh,
  a buried-tube well model, circuit hydraulics with a header-sizing engine, and an
  interactive PySide6 GUI.
authors:
  - family-names: "D'Acunzio"
    given-names: "Tommaso"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-9081-1852"
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/tomdacu/thermal_battery_simulator"
keywords:
  - sand battery
  - thermal energy storage
  - packed bed
  - finite volume
  - heat transfer
  - numerical simulation
type: software
